The IDE path calls `dev_wdc_tick()` before the register-access handler returns, so its completion assertions can be synchronous. UART and keyboard command paths can also assert synchronously. IRQ 12 needs a separate caveat: it is connected, but the 8042 access path appears unable to enable the mouse interrupt.
